```lean
def componentsOf [DecidableEq α] (seed : Finset α) (pairs : List (α × α)) : Finset (Finset α) :=
  pairs.foldl (fun P ab => mergePair P ab.1 ab.2) (seed.image (fun a => ({a} : Finset α)))
```

